Z||000000||Formula88||09-14-2001||12:02 AM||||Yadda yadda yadda<P>------------------<BR>The path of the righteous man is beset on all sides by the inequities of the selfish and the tyrranys of evil men. Blessed is he who in the name of charity and good will shepards the weak through the valley of darkness for he is truly his brothers keeper, and the finder of lost children. And I shall strike down upon thee with great vengence and furious anger, those who attempt to poison and destroy my brothers. And you will know my name is the lord when I lay my vengence upon thee. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfmast_glory.gif"> ||||reg||1
